{"transcription": [{"offsets": {"from": 1000, "to": 3000}, "text": " Artemis 1 is going to launch."}, {"offsets": {"from": 3000, "to": 5000}, "text": " Come on."}, {"offsets": {"from": 5000, "to": 7000}, "text": " Look at this."}, {"offsets": {"from": 7000, "to": 9000}, "text": " It's sparking that sucker."}, {"offsets": {"from": 9000, "to": 11000}, "text": " Come on."}, {"offsets": {"from": 13000, "to": 15000}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 15000, "to": 17000}, "text": " Look at that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 17000, "to": 19000}, "text": " Look at the water pumping in there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 19000, "to": 21000}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 21000, "to": 23000}, "text": " Oh, look at this."}, {"offsets": {"from": 23000, "to": 25000}, "text": " Look at this."}, {"offsets": {"from": 25000, "to": 27000}, "text": " Cleared the tower."}, {"offsets": {"from": 27000, "to": 29000}, "text": " Go, you little beauty."}, {"offsets": {"from": 29000, "to": 31000}, "text": " Go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 45000, "to": 47000}, "text": " Thanks so much, Dave."}, {"offsets": {"from": 47000, "to": 50000}, "text": " So right now we're actually joined by members of the Red Crew."}, {"offsets": {"from": 50000, "to": 55000}, "text": " You'll remember from watching the launch coverage that the Red Crew was sent out by the launch team when the launch team identified a small leak on a hydrogen valve inside the engine."}, {"offsets": {"from": 55000, "to": 57000}, "text": " Oh, Spanadu."}, {"offsets": {"from": 57000, "to": 59000}, "text": " This is Spanadu."}, {"offsets": {"from": 59000, "to": 61000}, "text": " Yes, they got Spanadu."}, {"offsets": {"from": 61000, "to": 63000}, "text": " Now, here they are."}, {"offsets": {"from": 63000, "to": 65000}, "text": " This is Trent and it's Trent."}, {"offsets": {"from": 65000, "to": 67000}, "text": " Can you just introduce everybody else here on your team?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 67000, "to": 69000}, "text": " Yeah, so this is Chad."}, {"offsets": {"from": 69000, "to": 71000}, "text": " He's our safety guy."}, {"offsets": {"from": 71000, "to": 73000}, "text": " Chad."}, {"offsets": {"from": 73000, "to": 75000}, "text": " And behind me is Billy."}, {"offsets": {"from": 75000, "to": 77000}, "text": " Billy."}, {"offsets": {"from": 77000, "to": 79000}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 79000, "to": 81000}, "text": " Billy did the job."}, {"offsets": {"from": 81000, "to": 83000}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 83000, "to": 85000}, "text": " Last danger zone."}, {"offsets": {"from": 85000, "to": 87000}, "text": " Good on him."}, {"offsets": {"from": 87000, "to": 89000}, "text": " Legends."}, {"offsets": {"from": 91000, "to": 93000}, "text": " Put Billy on."}, {"offsets": {"from": 93000, "to": 95000}, "text": " Give Billy the mic."}, {"offsets": {"from": 95000, "to": 97000}, "text": " Yeah, all I can say is we were very excited."}, {"offsets": {"from": 97000, "to": 99000}, "text": " I was ready to get up there and go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 99000, "to": 101000}, "text": " Really?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 101000, "to": 103000}, "text": " How were you guys feeling?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 103000, "to": 107000}, "text": " Very comfortable, very confident in the test team and the procedures and our training."}, {"offsets": {"from": 107000, "to": 109000}, "text": " We did a great job."}, {"offsets": {"from": 109000, "to": 111000}, "text": " Good on you, Chad."}, {"offsets": {"from": 111000, "to": 113000}, "text": " How gratifying it must be for you guys."}, {"offsets": {"from": 113000, "to": 115000}, "text": " You train for this eventuality but don't always get to do it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 115000, "to": 119000}, "text": " Billy was saying that he's been a Red Crew team member for 37 years."}, {"offsets": {"from": 119000, "to": 121000}, "text": " 37 years he's been on the team."}, {"offsets": {"from": 121000, "to": 123000}, "text": " Give the mic to Billy."}, {"offsets": {"from": 123000, "to": 125000}, "text": " Not the young kid."}, {"offsets": {"from": 125000, "to": 127000}, "text": " Give it to Billy."}, {"offsets": {"from": 127000, "to": 129000}, "text": " Come on."}, {"offsets": {"from": 129000, "to": 131000}, "text": " You really want to put that training into practice."}, {"offsets": {"from": 131000, "to": 133000}, "text": " How do you guys feel like it went today?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 133000, "to": 135000}, "text": " Amazing."}, {"offsets": {"from": 135000, "to": 137000}, "text": " I still can't believe it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 137000, "to": 139000}, "text": " It's surreal to me."}, {"offsets": {"from": 139000, "to": 141000}, "text": " Tell us what you were thinking."}, {"offsets": {"from": 141000, "to": 143000}, "text": " You get there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 143000, "to": 145000}, "text": " Game time and you're really focused."}, {"offsets": {"from": 145000, "to": 147000}, "text": " How are you feeling?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 147000, "to": 153000}, "text": " I'd say we were very focused on what was happening up there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 153000, "to": 157000}, "text": " Just making sure we knew what was happening."}, {"offsets": {"from": 157000, "to": 159000}, "text": " It's alive."}, {"offsets": {"from": 159000, "to": 161000}, "text": " It's creaking."}, {"offsets": {"from": 161000, "to": 163000}, "text": " Give me Billy."}, {"offsets": {"from": 163000, "to": 165000}, "text": " Billy's the man."}, {"offsets": {"from": 165000, "to": 167000}, "text": " On zero deck, my heart was pumping."}, {"offsets": {"from": 167000, "to": 169000}, "text": " He's the hydrogen guy."}, {"offsets": {"from": 169000, "to": 171000}, "text": " We showed up today."}, {"offsets": {"from": 171000, "to": 173000}, "text": " As soon as we walked up those stairs we were ready to rock and roll."}, {"offsets": {"from": 173000, "to": 175000}, "text": " They were telling us a bit about it while you were working on it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 175000, "to": 181000}, "text": " You guys were actually just torquing down the valve to reduce the leak rate."}, {"offsets": {"from": 181000, "to": 185000}, "text": " I think Destin's dad is involved in that somehow."}, {"offsets": {"from": 185000, "to": 187000}, "text": " Went up there and tightened her up."}, {"offsets": {"from": 187000, "to": 193000}, "text": " You're probably still in this oh my gosh moment like all of us are."}, {"offsets": {"from": 193000, "to": 199000}, "text": " Has it actually hit you, the role you played today in making Artemis 1 launch?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 199000, "to": 201000}, "text": " Of course it has."}, {"offsets": {"from": 201000, "to": 203000}, "text": " Billy knows."}, {"offsets": {"from": 203000, "to": 205000}, "text": " Like I said, it's surreal and just amazing."}, {"offsets": {"from": 205000, "to": 207000}, "text": " No."}, {"offsets": {"from": 207000, "to": 209000}, "text": " Give the mic to Billy."}, {"offsets": {"from": 209000, "to": 211000}, "text": " I don't know about you guys."}, {"offsets": {"from": 211000, "to": 213000}, "text": " They're nodding along behind you."}, {"offsets": {"from": 213000, "to": 215000}, "text": " Give the mic to Billy."}, {"offsets": {"from": 215000, "to": 219000}, "text": " This is a big day for the launch team, for you guys, NASA."}, {"offsets": {"from": 219000, "to": 221000}, "text": " We want Billy."}, {"offsets": {"from": 221000, "to": 225000}, "text": " This is a historic launch that I think we'll all remember."}, {"offsets": {"from": 225000, "to": 227000}, "text": " We'll all remember, really."}, {"offsets": {"from": 227000, "to": 229000}, "text": " Helping us out."}, {"offsets": {"from": 229000, "to": 231000}, "text": " A lot of teams."}, {"offsets": {"from": 231000, "to": 233000}, "text": " Fire room."}, {"offsets": {"from": 233000, "to": 235000}, "text": " I'm sure that was hectic."}, {"offsets": {"from": 235000, "to": 237000}, "text": " NASA, Boeing, all the other companies did a great job."}, {"offsets": {"from": 237000, "to": 239000}, "text": " We're glad to be part of it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 239000, "to": 241000}, "text": " One thing I always like to say is spaceflight is a team sport."}, {"offsets": {"from": 241000, "to": 243000}, "text": " Yes, I agree."}, {"offsets": {"from": 243000, "to": 245000}, "text": " Give Billy his five minutes of fame."}, {"offsets": {"from": 245000, "to": 247000}, "text": " None of us could accomplish this on our own."}, {"offsets": {"from": 247000, "to": 249000}, "text": " It takes a really complex team."}, {"offsets": {"from": 249000, "to": 251000}, "text": " Nobody can be an expert in all the systems, all the technology."}, {"offsets": {"from": 251000, "to": 253000}, "text": " I want to hear from Billy."}, {"offsets": {"from": 253000, "to": 255000}, "text": " I reckon, yes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 255000, "to": 257000}, "text": " Great disrespect to Billy."}, {"offsets": {"from": 257000, "to": 259000}, "text": " I agree."}, {"offsets": {"from": 259000, "to": 261000}, "text": " Thank you so much, guys."}, {"offsets": {"from": 261000, "to": 263000}, "text": " I appreciate you coming by to talk with us."}, {"offsets": {"from": 263000, "to": 265000}, "text": " No."}, {"offsets": {"from": 265000, "to": 267000}, "text": " It's now been about 35 minutes since the liftoff of Artemis 1."}, {"offsets": {"from": 267000, "to": 269000}, "text": " Great disrespect to Billy indeed."}, {"offsets": {"from": 269000, "to": 271000}, "text": " Let's head back to Leah again to talk about how the journey is going so far."}, {"offsets": {"from": 271000, "to": 273000}, "text": " That's disgraceful."}, {"offsets": {"from": 273000, "to": 275000}, "text": " It has been a pretty smooth ride so far."}, {"offsets": {"from": 275000, "to": 277000}, "text": " Anyone else think that's disgraceful?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 277000, "to": 279000}, "text": " Billy needs a bonus."}, {"offsets": {"from": 279000, "to": 281000}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 281000, "to": 283000}, "text": " Am I the one that thinks that's disgraceful?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 283000, "to": 285000}, "text": " He's been there for what?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 285000, "to": 287000}, "text": " 37 years or something?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 287000, "to": 289000}, "text": " He's been the hydrogen guy."}, {"offsets": {"from": 289000, "to": 291000}, "text": " Not happy."}, {"offsets": {"from": 291000, "to": 293000}, "text": " Not happy."}, {"offsets": {"from": 293000, "to": 295000}, "text": " It's not just me."}, {"offsets": {"from": 295000, "to": 297000}, "text": " Yeah, exactly."}, {"offsets": {"from": 297000, "to": 299000}, "text": " 37 years in that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 299000, "to": 301000}, "text": " He's just a guy nodding in the background."}, {"offsets": {"from": 301000, "to": 303000}, "text": " No."}, {"offsets": {"from": 303000, "to": 305000}, "text": " No, get Billy back on."}, {"offsets": {"from": 305000, "to": 307000}, "text": " I want to hear from Billy."}, {"offsets": {"from": 307000, "to": 309000}, "text": " Visual spacecraft performance."}, {"offsets": {"from": 313000, "to": 315000}, "text": " Well, this team's failed."}, {"offsets": {"from": 315000, "to": 317000}, "text": " Epically."}, {"offsets": {"from": 319000, "to": 321000}, "text": " Lower resolution."}, {"offsets": {"from": 321000, "to": 323000}, "text": " We got two seconds and then nothing."}, {"offsets": {"from": 323000, "to": 325000}, "text": " We didn't even get the low res."}, {"offsets": {"from": 325000, "to": 327000}, "text": " We're getting jacked."}, {"offsets": {"from": 327000, "to": 329000}, "text": " We're getting absolutely jacked from this."}, {"offsets": {"from": 329000, "to": 331000}, "text": " We're getting nothing."}, {"offsets": {"from": 331000, "to": 333000}, "text": " We got not one inside shot."}, {"offsets": {"from": 335000, "to": 337000}, "text": " Dozens and dozens of engineers"}, {"offsets": {"from": 337000, "to": 339000}, "text": " and techs."}, {"offsets": {"from": 339000, "to": 341000}, "text": " Working on"}, {"offsets": {"from": 341000, "to": 343000}, "text": " the vision system."}, {"offsets": {"from": 345000, "to": 347000}, "text": " And they're giving us nothing."}, {"offsets": {"from": 347000, "to": 349000}, "text": " They're giving us nothing."}, {"offsets": {"from": 349000, "to": 351000}, "text": " That team failed."}, {"offsets": {"from": 351000, "to": 353000}, "text": " So that team got their"}, {"offsets": {"from": 353000, "to": 355000}, "text": " five minutes of bloody"}, {"offsets": {"from": 355000, "to": 357000}, "text": " promo roll, right?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 357000, "to": 359000}, "text": " They didn't let Billy."}, {"offsets": {"from": 361000, "to": 363000}, "text": " Oh, Billy!"}, {"offsets": {"from": 365000, "to": 367000}, "text": " Billy!"}, {"offsets": {"from": 367000, "to": 369000}, "text": " We want to see Billy on the red team."}, {"offsets": {"from": 369000, "to": 371000}, "text": " They streamed the original movie."}, {"offsets": {"from": 371000, "to": 373000}, "text": " Yeah, we got better footage from the original Apollo mission."}, {"offsets": {"from": 373000, "to": 375000}, "text": " Than we did with this."}, {"offsets": {"from": 375000, "to": 377000}, "text": " Yeah, if we had Billy do the cameras"}, {"offsets": {"from": 377000, "to": 379000}, "text": " they would have worked. I agree."}, {"offsets": {"from": 379000, "to": 381000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 381000, "to": 383000}, "text": " Billy should have worked on the cameras as well."}, {"offsets": {"from": 383000, "to": 385000}, "text": " We don't have the space cameras. At least give us Billy."}, {"offsets": {"from": 385000, "to": 387000}, "text": " Yeah!"}, {"offsets": {"from": 387000, "to": 389000}, "text": " Have a Billy appreciation"}, {"offsets": {"from": 389000, "to": 391000}, "text": " video."}, {"offsets": {"from": 391000, "to": 393000}, "text": " And yes, Billy's the man."}, {"offsets": {"from": 393000, "to": 395000}, "text": " Billy. We demand Billy."}, {"offsets": {"from": 395000, "to": 397000}, "text": " You see that vault right there?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 397000, "to": 399000}, "text": " Yeah, Billy beat the shit out of it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 399000, "to": 401000}, "text": " Billy's the man."}, {"offsets": {"from": 401000, "to": 403000}, "text": " He just looked like he could get the job done."}, {"offsets": {"from": 403000, "to": 405000}, "text": " He's been there for, what was it?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 405000, "to": 407000}, "text": " 37 years."}, {"offsets": {"from": 407000, "to": 409000}, "text": " He's been working in the red team."}, {"offsets": {"from": 409000, "to": 411000}, "text": " The guys that go out to the paddocks"}, {"offsets": {"from": 411000, "to": 413000}, "text": " with their wrench and"}, {"offsets": {"from": 413000, "to": 415000}, "text": " make shit work."}, {"offsets": {"from": 415000, "to": 417000}, "text": " Billy's like,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 417000, "to": 419000}, "text": " I don't get all the farts. This is just Tuesday."}, {"offsets": {"from": 419000, "to": 421000}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 421000, "to": 423000}, "text": " Exactly."}, {"offsets": {"from": 423000, "to": 425000}, "text": " I want to get a Billy appreciation"}, {"offsets": {"from": 425000, "to": 427000}, "text": " society going."}, {"offsets": {"from": 427000, "to": 429000}, "text": " Who's with me?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 429000, "to": 431000}, "text": " 4.1 billion per launch."}, {"offsets": {"from": 431000, "to": 433000}, "text": " Billion."}, {"offsets": {"from": 433000, "to": 435000}, "text": " Billy t-shirts."}, {"offsets": {"from": 435000, "to": 437000}, "text": " Yep. He needs his five minutes of fame."}, {"offsets": {"from": 437000, "to": 439000}, "text": " Billy plushies."}, {"offsets": {"from": 439000, "to": 441000}, "text": " Yes. Billy merch."}, {"offsets": {"from": 441000, "to": 443000}, "text": " You reckon Billy"}, {"offsets": {"from": 443000, "to": 445000}, "text": " worked with your grandfather?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 445000, "to": 447000}, "text": " He's been there 37 years."}, {"offsets": {"from": 447000, "to": 449000}, "text": " Billy for NASA CEO."}, {"offsets": {"from": 449000, "to": 451000}, "text": " Billy for flight director."}, {"offsets": {"from": 451000, "to": 453000}, "text": " I reckon Billy should be flight director."}, {"offsets": {"from": 453000, "to": 455000}, "text": " I want the Billy vibe."}, {"offsets": {"from": 455000, "to": 457000}, "text": " Billy branded screwdriver"}, {"offsets": {"from": 457000, "to": 459000}, "text": " and wrench sets."}, {"offsets": {"from": 459000, "to": 461000}, "text": " Yes. Yes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 461000, "to": 463000}, "text": " I would buy a Billy branded screwdriver"}, {"offsets": {"from": 463000, "to": 465000}, "text": " and wrench set. You bet."}, {"offsets": {"from": 465000, "to": 467000}, "text": " Somehow I doubt Billy is an online guy."}, {"offsets": {"from": 467000, "to": 469000}, "text": " Yeah. What's this?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 469000, "to": 471000}, "text": " Newfangled internet."}, {"offsets": {"from": 471000, "to": 473000}, "text": " I make rockets fly. A Billy multimeter."}, {"offsets": {"from": 473000, "to": 475000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 475000, "to": 477000}, "text": " Linus Tech Tips. Billy driver."}, {"offsets": {"from": 477000, "to": 479000}, "text": " Billion of the year. Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 479000, "to": 481000}, "text": " Billy looks like a percussive maintenance guru."}, {"offsets": {"from": 481000, "to": 483000}, "text": " I agree. Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 483000, "to": 485000}, "text": " He can make that sucker go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 485000, "to": 487000}, "text": " Built by Billy t-shirts."}, {"offsets": {"from": 487000, "to": 489000}, "text": " Yeah. There's got to be a t-shirt in it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 489000, "to": 491000}, "text": " Can somebody get me a high res"}, {"offsets": {"from": 491000, "to": 493000}, "text": " photo of Billy?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 493000, "to": 495000}, "text": " Is Billy anywhere else?"}], "source": "whisper-1-api"}